  "name": "Spectral Defense",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your ability to move between planes enables you to slip through the planar boundaries to lessen the harm done to you during battle. When you take damage from an attack or an effect that requires you to make a Dexterity Saving Throw, you can use your Reaction to give yourself Resistance to all of that attack's damage on this turn.</p>",
